{
  "name": "Send a number to Ziffr",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3f0c5a4e-0b1d-4c55-9a1e-6c2f6f0a1001",
      "name": "Execute workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0c5a4e-0b1d-4c55-9a1e-6c2f6f0a1002",
      "name": "Every day at 9",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0c5a4e-0b1d-4c55-9a1e-6c2f6f0a1003",
      "name": "Value",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "3f0c5a4e-0b1d-4c55-9a1e-6c2f6f0a1006",
              "name": "value",
              "value": "={{ Math.floor(Math.random() * 5) + 1 }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0c5a4e-0b1d-4c55-9a1e-6c2f6f0a1004",
      "name": "Send to Ziffr",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://ziffr.example.com/api/v1/feed/observations",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer zk_your_feed_key"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ $execution.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\"items\":[{\"metric\":\"your-metric-slug\",\"value\": {{ $json.value }} }]}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3f0c5a4e-0b1d-4c55-9a1e-6c2f6f0a1005",
      "name": "What this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send a number to Ziffr\nPress **Execute workflow**: **Value** picks a number from 1 to 5 and **Send to Ziffr** records it for `your-metric-slug` as today's value.\n\nThe Feed Key in the Authorization header comes from Ziffr (the Setup Guide of a trial, or Settings, then Feeds). For real use, put it in an n8n credential (Header Auth, name `Authorization`, value `Bearer <key>`) instead of the header field.\n\n**Every day at 9** sends a value daily once you turn it on.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 560
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Execute workflow": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Value",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Every day at 9": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Value",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Value": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to Ziffr",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
